{"id":"hierfu_r","lemma":"hierfür","pos":"adv","rank":4636,"glosses":["for this (purpose), therefore"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/5/5a/De-hierf%C3%BCr.ogg/De-hierf%C3%BCr.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Der Grund hierfür ist klar.","en":"The reason for this is plain.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"ground, land"},null,{"g":"is","l":"sein"},{"g":"okay!"}]},{"text":"Hierfür werde ich bezahlt.","en":"This is what I get paid to do.","words":[null,{"g":"to become","l":"werden"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"to pay","l":"bezahlen"}]},{"text":"Der Grund hierfür liegt auf der Hand.","en":"The reason for this is plain.","words":[{"g":"the"},{"g":"ground, land"},null,{"g":"to lie","l":"liegen"},{"g":"on"},{"g":"the"},{"g":"hand"}]},{"text":"Hierfür habe ich lange geübt.","en":"I've been practicing a long time for this.","words":[null,{"g":"have","l":"haben"},{"g":"I"},{"g":"long, for a long time"},{"g":"to practice","l":"üben"}]},{"text":"Gibt es hierfür eine Grundlage?","en":"Is there some basis for this?","words":[{"g":"to give","l":"geben"},{"g":"it"},null,{"g":"a"},{"g":"foundation"}]}]}